    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Rod, Very Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This rod has the following properties.</p><p><strong>Alertness.</strong> While holding the rod, you have Advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks and on Initiative rolls.</p><p><strong>Spells.</strong> While holding the rod, you can cast the following spells from it: @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplDetectEvil]{Detect Evil and Good}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplDetectMagi]{Detect Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplDetectPois]{Detect Poison and Disease}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplSeeInvisib]{See Invisibility}.</p><p><strong>Protective Aura.</strong> As a Magic action, you can plant the haft end of the rod in the ground, whereupon the rod’s head sheds Bright Light in a 60-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 60 feet. While in that Bright Light, you and your allies gain a +1 bonus to Armor Class and saving throws and can sense the location of any Invisible creature that is also in the Bright Light.</p><p>The rod’s head stops glowing and the effect ends after 10 minutes or when a creature takes a Magic action to pull the rod from the ground. Once used, this property can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-jGrucoqKAFLoFtqT\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Protective Aura</strong> activity can be used to place a 60 foot template representing the Bright Light radius. It includes an Active Effect which can be applied to the relevant Actors and adds the +1 bonus to AC and Saving Throws.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
